---
const faqs = [
  {
    question:
      "Can LKProfessionals build a website for a charity or non-profit organisation?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Websites can be designed around the organisation's mission, programmes, campaigns, news, volunteering, contact and supporter requirements.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can a non-profit website accept online donations?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Suitable donation or contribution workflows can be integrated where supported payment providers and organisational requirements allow it.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can donor and supporter records be managed in a CRM?",
    answer:
      "Yes. A CRM can centralise supporter records, communication history, campaigns and other agreed relationship information.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can volunteer management be digitised?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Registration, availability, assignments, communication and related volunteer workflows can be structured digitally.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can programme or grant reporting be improved with software?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Programme, milestone, budget and activity information can be structured so reporting relies less on manually combining disconnected records.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can projects be phased to suit a limited non-profit budget?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Phased delivery can prioritise the workflows with the clearest operational or supporter value before expanding into additional capabilities.",
  },
];
---

<section class="nonprofit-faq">
  <div class="site-container nonprofit-faq__layout">
    <div>
      <p>Non-profit FAQ</p>

      <h2>
        Questions to answer before spending another programme budget on software.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="nonprofit-faq__list">
      {
        faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .nonprofit-faq {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .nonprofit-faq__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(17rem, 0.7fr)
      minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .nonprofit-faq__layout
    > div:first-child > p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #0b2f8f;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .nonprofit-faq h2 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #0d203c;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .nonprofit-faq__list {
    border-top: 1px solid #dce3ec;
  }

  .nonprofit-faq details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dce3ec;
    padding-block: 1rem;
  }

  .nonprofit-faq summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #293b53;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 740;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .nonprofit-faq details p {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: #788497;
    font-size: 0.69rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .nonprofit-faq__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
